  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Create a <code>StringDecoder</code> for <code>\"text/plain\"</code>.",
      "translation": "为 `\"text/plain\"` 创建一个 `<code>StringDecoder</code>。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a <code>StringDecoder</code> that supports all MIME types.",
      "translation": "创建一个支持所有 MIME 类型的<code>StringDecoder</code>。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>stripDelimiter</code> - whether to remove delimiters from the resulting\ninput strings",
      "translation": "<code>stripDelimiter</code> - 是否从生成的输入字符串中移除分隔符",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Decode from a data buffer stream to a <code>String</code> stream, either splitting\nor aggregating incoming data chunks to realign along newlines delimiters\nand produce a stream of strings. This is useful for streaming but is also\nnecessary to ensure that multi-byte characters can be decoded correctly,\navoiding split-character issues. The default delimiters used by default are\n<code>\\n</code> and <code>\\r\\n</code> but that can be customized.",
      "translation": "从数据缓冲区流解码到 `<code>String</code>` 流，通过将传入的数据块拆分或聚合以重新对齐换行符分隔符来生成字符串流。这对于流式处理非常有用，同时也是为了确保多字节字符能够正确解码，避免字符被错误拆分的问题。默认使用的分隔符是 `<code>\\n</code>` 和 `<code>\\r\\n</code>`，但可以进行自定义。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Template method that decodes the given data buffer into <code>T</code>, given\nthe charset.",
      "translation": "将给定的数据缓冲区解码为 `<code>T</code>` 的模板方法，给定字符集。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether the decoder supports the given target element type and the MIME\ntype of the source stream.",
      "translation": "解码器是否支持给定的目标元素类型以及源流的 MIME 类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
